        "content": "## Sheet -> MongoDB sync v2 (4 pools)\nHar ghante :55. INCREMENTAL: sirf pichle 2 din me badli rows (last_updated / first_seen / last_checked).\nRoz raat 3 baje + har MANUAL run = poori sheet. URL ek format me (www, chhote akshar).\nCANDIDATE_MASTER (chaaron tab + country) padhta hai.\nServiceNow -> Mongo ServiceNow | AI/ML -> Mongo AI_ML\nSalesforce -> Mongo Salesforce | Workday -> Mongo Workday (naya cluster)\nCollection: candidates_master. LinkedIn URL se match: naya = insert, purana = update.",
